{"3691550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rock Paper Scissors Party", "steam_appid": 3691550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/7006bd7f1e86f7f575412cdcc1778dbe.avif?t=1776169694\" width=1000 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Rock–Paper–Scissors... but this time, it’s in the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle and compete with your friends online in a fast-paced, chaotic party experience! Discover various game modes, multiple maps, character costumes, and powerful special abilities waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/438b0fa3bca0dcfd6564d65c6d8c2b56.poster.avif?t=1776169694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/438b0fa3bca0dcfd6564d65c6d8c2b56.webm?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/438b0fa3bca0dcfd6564d65c6d8c2b56.mp4?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Rock–Paper–Scissors Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character can damage anyone, but you are far more powerful against the right opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/bd6178045bcc289c0a9f8eae9a16d256.poster.avif?t=1776169694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/bd6178045bcc289c0a9f8eae9a16d256.webm?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/bd6178045bcc289c0a9f8eae9a16d256.mp4?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a team or duel one-on-one. Compete and have fun with mission and contest-based modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/9c892bb60da79a5acbcbea1762553876.poster.avif?t=1776169694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/9c892bb60da79a5acbcbea1762553876.webm?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/9c892bb60da79a5acbcbea1762553876.mp4?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Abilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, dash, slide, and spit! These are your core skills. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various abilities from the map and use them tactically. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience points and gain an advantage with your character's special ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/411998e0f5c611ccac90cea4d4eb5bd7.poster.avif?t=1776169694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/411998e0f5c611ccac90cea4d4eb5bd7.webm?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/411998e0f5c611ccac90cea4d4eb5bd7.mp4?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Party</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with your friends or players from all over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exciting mechanics across different maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena has unique environmental elements, use them smartly to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Costumes &amp; Accessories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your costume and shape your character. Battle by reflecting your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/7006bd7f1e86f7f575412cdcc1778dbe.avif?t=1776169694\" width=1000 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Rock–Paper–Scissors... but this time, it’s in the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle and compete with your friends online in a fast-paced, chaotic party experience! Discover various game modes, multiple maps, character costumes, and powerful special abilities waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/438b0fa3bca0dcfd6564d65c6d8c2b56.poster.avif?t=1776169694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/438b0fa3bca0dcfd6564d65c6d8c2b56.webm?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/438b0fa3bca0dcfd6564d65c6d8c2b56.mp4?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Rock–Paper–Scissors Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character can damage anyone, but you are far more powerful against the right opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/bd6178045bcc289c0a9f8eae9a16d256.poster.avif?t=1776169694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/bd6178045bcc289c0a9f8eae9a16d256.webm?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/bd6178045bcc289c0a9f8eae9a16d256.mp4?t=1776169694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a team or duel one-on-one. Compete and have fun with mission and contest-based modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"